Graphics in Output cells (design 6): pictures come as `display` responses; resizing stores `size=WxH` on the
output block, keeps it across re-evaluation, and restoring the natural size removes it.

=== a picture value becomes an Output cell holding its image value
--- before
#% cell
image("p.png")▮
--- keys
Shift+Enter
--- after
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1
#= image("p.png")
‖

=== resizing stores the size on the output block, undo takes it back
--- before
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1
#= image("p.png")
‖
--- keys
Resize(1,320,200)
--- after
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1 size=320x200
#= image("p.png")
‖

=== undoing a resize
--- before
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1
#= image("p.png")
‖
--- keys
Resize(1,320,200) Ctrl+Z
--- after
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1
#= image("p.png")
‖

=== a double-click restores the natural size
--- before
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1 size=320x200
#= image("p.png")
‖
--- keys
Resize(1)
--- after
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1
#= image("p.png")
‖

=== the size is kept when the input is evaluated again and shows a picture again
--- before
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")▮
#% output n=1 size=320x200
#= image("p.png")
--- keys
Shift+Enter
--- after
#% cell label=1
image("p.png")
#% output n=1 size=320x200
#= image("p.png")
‖

=== the k-th picture keeps the k-th size; a value that is not a picture takes none
--- before
#% cell label=1
image("a.png")
7
image("b.png")▮
#% output n=1 size=100x50
#= image("a.png")
#% output n=2 size=300x150
#= image("b.png")
--- keys
Shift+Enter
--- after
#% cell label=1
image("a.png")
7
image("b.png")
#% output n=1 size=100x50
#= image("a.png")
#% output n=2
#= 7
#% output n=3 size=300x150
#= image("b.png")
‖

=== resizing something that is not a graphic does nothing
--- before
#% cell label=1
1+1
#% output n=1
#= 2
‖
--- keys
Resize(1,320,200)
--- after
#% cell label=1
1+1
#% output n=1
#= 2
‖
